      en: ["The heavily illuminated boulevard is approximately 4.2 miles (6.8 km) long.", "Technically, the majority of the Strip lies in the unincorporated town of Paradise.", "Fifteen of the world's twenty-five largest hotels are located on the Strip.", "The famous 'Welcome to Fabulous Las Vegas' sign was erected in 1959.", "The Mirage is globally famous for its massive synchronized dancing water fountains.", "The first casino resort on Highway 91, the El Rancho Vegas, opened in 1941."]
