      en: ["The spectacular outdoor amphitheater officially opened on July 11, 1922.", "It serves as the renowned summer home of the Los Angeles Philharmonic.", "The iconic concentric-arched acoustic shell was primarily finalized in 1929.", "The massive venue comfortably seats exactly 17,500 spectators.", "The Beatles performed legendary, highly publicized concerts here in 1964 and 1965.", "The Bowl is carved directly into a natural concave hillside in the Santa Monica Mountains."]
